column76:
This works even cooler when you want to minify your code:<p>MyLongClassName = function() {};<p>function(_c) {
  _c.prototype.method1 = ...;
  _c.prototype.method2 = ...;
}(MyLongClassName);<p>This allows something like YUI compressor to shorten _c local variable for every method definition, rather than store "MyLongClassName" for each one.
